---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact Us"
  description="Get in touch with the GearCompared team. Questions, corrections, or product suggestions — we read every message."
>
  <main class="content">
    <article>
      <header class="article-header">
        <h1>Contact Us</h1>
        <p class="article-desc">
          Have a question, correction, or a product you'd like us to review? We'd love to hear from you.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="guide-section">
        <h2>Email Us</h2>
        <p>
          <a href="mailto:feedback@gearcompared.com">feedback@gearcompared.com</a>
        </p>
        <p>
          We read every message. We can't always respond to everyone, but we do take all feedback seriously — especially if you catch an error or have firsthand experience with a product we've reviewed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="guide-section">
        <h2>What to Reach Out About</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Corrections</strong> — if we got something wrong, tell us and we'll fix it fast</li>
          <li><strong>Personal experience</strong> — own a product we reviewed? We want to hear what you think</li>
          <li><strong>Product suggestions</strong> — is there a product we should review? Let us know</li>
          <li><strong>Press and partnerships</strong> — we don't sell reviews or placement, but we're open to legitimate collaboration</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="guide-section">
        <h2>Response Time</h2>
        <p>
          We aim to respond within 2-3 business days. If you're writing about an urgent correction, put "Correction" in the subject line and we'll prioritize it.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
